---
source: crates/biome_formatter_test/src/snapshot_builder.rs
info: scss/comments/property-value-line-comments/property-value-line-comments.scss
---

# Input

```scss
.canonical {
  background:
        /////// foo
        // bar

    radial-gradient(circle, #000, transparent);
}

.ugly {
    background:
        /////// foo
        // bar

        radial-gradient(circle, #000, transparent);
}

.different-columns {
  color:
      // six spaces
        // eight spaces
      red;
}

.same-line {
  color: // same line
    red;
}

.mixed {
  border: /* block */
        // line
      solid red;
}

.suppression {
  color:
        // biome-ignore format: reason
      red;
}

```


# Options

```json
{
  "$schema": "../../../../../../../packages/@biomejs/biome/configuration_schema.json",
  "formatter": {
    "indentStyle": "space",
    "indentWidth": 2
  }
}
```

# Formatted

```scss
.canonical {
  background:
        /////// foo
        // bar
    radial-gradient(circle, #000, transparent);
}

.ugly {
  background:
        /////// foo
        // bar
    radial-gradient(circle, #000, transparent);
}

.different-columns {
  color:
      // six spaces
        // eight spaces
    red;
}

.same-line {
  color: // same line
    red;
}

.mixed {
  border: /* block */
        // line
    solid red;
}

.suppression {
  color:
        // biome-ignore format: reason
      red;
}

```
